{"unit_id":"vibeinging__dsh-agent-budget#card-zh","repo":"vibeinging/dsh-agent-budget","commit":"2702e6d4846d478c01ff09ccbb54fc9f6313daba","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-budget 为 DSH 会话或 agent 后代树设置持久 Token 限额与截止时间。它在模型请求前预留估算用量，流结束后按报告结算；软模式记录超额，硬模式拒绝超限请求。用户可用 /budget 查看、创建和增加预算。适合需要控制单个会话或多 agent 树消耗的场景，依赖 DSH Agent、LLM、Session 与 Storage Domain 服务。bundle 默认采用 tree 范围和 hard 模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:552","src/index.ts:557","src/command.ts:222","cordis.patch.yml:1"]}
